== UNVERIFIED values (ratchet: must not grow)
UNVERIFIED GPIO_PIN_PREFIX: header pin -> GPIO table is third-party gpiozero (author's own caveat for Pi 5, pinmap.conf) and the line names are read from the dts, not from gpioinfo on a real Pi 5 (HW); gs.conf pin values reach gpio_find only after the M3c wiring
UNVERIFIED PART_OVERLAY_NUM: design for the M6 spike: no image with this layout was built, overlayroot on Pi OS is untested
UNVERIFIED PART_VIDEOS_NUM: design for the M6 spike: gs-init.sh parted mkpart videos has no logical/extended handling, untested
UNVERIFIED THERMAL_CPU_TEMP_FILE: HW: the zone index 0 is not read from a source; check `cat /sys/class/thermal/thermal_zone*/type` = cpu-thermal
